1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,020
You want your company's AI chatbot

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,700
to answer like your best support

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,500
person.

4
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:05,220
Instead,

5
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,979
it tells a customer refunds take

6
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,100
sixty days.

7
00:00:08,139 --> 00:00:09,860
The real policy is thirty.

8
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,299
And now you're the one explaining

9
00:00:11,379 --> 00:00:12,580
it to your boss.

10
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:14,540
An AI shouldn't make things up.

11
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,020
It should show its work.

12
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:16,847
I get it.

13
00:00:16,873 --> 00:00:18,260
I've spent over ten years in

14
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,300
data engineering,

15
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,420
and here's the fix.

16
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,460
It's called RAG,

17
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,980
and it's three steps.

18
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,220
One: turn your documents into numbers

19
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,713
that capture their meaning,

20
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:27,940
and store them in a vector

21
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:28,900
database.

22
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,660
Two: when a question comes in,

23
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,420
grab the three paragraphs that match

24
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,380
it best.

25
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,380
Three: give those paragraphs to the

26
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:35,820
model,

27
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,340
so it answers from them,

28
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,620
with sources.

29
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,407
Skip this,

30
00:00:39,433 --> 00:00:40,820
and you'll pay for bigger models

31
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,380
that still make things up.

32
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:42,940
Do it,

33
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,580
and every answer comes from your

34
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,460
own documents,

35
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,847
with a link to the proof.

36
00:00:46,873 --> 00:00:48,313
And when the policy changes,

37
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:49,700
you update the document.

38
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,780
No retraining.

39
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:51,273
Follow,

40
00:00:51,327 --> 00:00:52,740
and learn RAG first.

41
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:53,180
Next,

42
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,900
I'll explain AI agents.

